{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-equiti-home","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"equiti-home-refine-development-jebel-ali-village","about":"Equiti Home is a luxury residential development by Refine offering 1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartments as well as 3 bedroom duplexes and 4 bedroom penthouses. This complex is a beacon of wealth on the serene outskirts of the city. Enjoy a dynamic family lifestyle amidst expansive greenery and spacious living spaces.Covering a vast area, this grand project comprises a first floor, two podiums and ten floors culminating in a rooftop plaza. Drawing inspiration from the city's rich cultural heritage, the design embodies simplicity and minimalism, creating an atmosphere of urban sophistication. Each residence is meticulously designed with intelligent home automation, fully furnished rooms and a host of modern conveniences at your fingertips.The 10,000-square-foot podium features numerous amenities and community spaces available exclusively to residents. From rejuvenating wellness centers such as a pool and gym to recreational areas such as a jogging track and basketball court, every aspect of Equiti Home is designed to promote a balanced and fulfilling lifestyle. The integration of green elements into the podium and balconies further enhances the sense of well-being, while on-site workspaces and retail outlets add convenience and charm to everyday life.","price":1078107,"title":"Equiti Home","bitrix":{"id":834,"pf_id":"are.2.13605","source":null,"project_id":"Equiti Home","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Equiti Home","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Refine Development","project_location":"Al Furjan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Equiti_Home_by_Refine_Development_in_Jebel_Ali_Village_108cb0dc74.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Equiti_Home_by_Refine_Development_in